---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { independentReviews } from '../../data/evidence-platform.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Independent review registry" description="Named reviewer qualifications, scope, conflicts, versions, external verification, decisions, and corrections.">
  <div class="shell"><section class="hero reading"><p class="eyebrow">Review registry</p><h1>Editorial review and independent review are different.</h1><p class="lede">An outside review appears only when the reviewer, qualification, scope, conflict disclosure, exact version, decision, and independently controlled verification are visible.</p></section>
  {independentReviews.length ? <div class="record-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Reviewer</th><th>Qualification</th><th>Version</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead><tbody>{independentReviews.map((item) => <tr><td>{item.reviewerName}</td><td>{item.reviewerQualification}</td><td>{item.reviewedVersion}</td><td>{item.decision}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div> : <section class="empty-evidence"><span class="status pending">0 independent reviews</span><h2>No outside review has passed the publication gate.</h2><p>AI Amigos editorial checks remain visible as internal review and are never relabeled as independent validation.</p><a class="button" href="/reviews/kit/">Open the external reviewer kit</a></section>}
  <section class="split-section section-space"><div><h2>Independent review requires</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Named reviewer and relevant qualification</li><li>Exact method or report version</li><li>Bounded review scope and decision</li><li>Conflict and compensation disclosure</li><li>Outside verification link</li></ul></div><div><h2>Reviewer independence is limited when</h2><ul><li>The reviewer created the work</li><li>The reviewer reports to the author</li><li>Compensation is undisclosed</li><li>The reviewed version is unclear</li><li>The statement is hosted only by AI Amigos</li></ul></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
